'' 'tiko test': the white-box test file of module util (reaching its private Half_) and a black-box
'' test file, in one program built under the debug profile; one failure exits 1. Each failed
'' check is printed under its test with its own file and line.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.ttr/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.ttr
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-pkg => build/.ttr/pkg
'' ARGS: test -target windows-x86_64 --manifest build/.ttr/pkg
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: running 3 tests
'' EXPECT-OUT: test Twice doubles ... ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: test Half_ is reachable from a white-box test ... ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: test a failing one ... FAILED
'' EXPECT-OUT: api_test.tiko:7: ExpectEq failed
'' EXPECT-OUT: test result: FAILED. 2 passed; 1 failed; 0 crashed; 0 timed out; 0 skipped
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.ttr/pkg/out/test/tests.tiko :: #import "../../src/util" as __tko_tm0
